      <chord name="Bb"/>Hiding in <chord name="Bb7"/>Thee, <chord name="Eb"/>hiding <chord name="Fm7"/>in<chord name="Eb"/>Thee,<br/>
      Thou blest “<chord name="Bb"/>Rock of <chord name="Eb"/>Ages,”<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>I’m <chord name="Eb"/>hid<chord name="Gm"/>ing <chord name="Bb7"/>in<chord name="Eb"/>Thee.
